  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a5f0d19b7e499034b982b45f923e8f6f, type: 3}
  description: This round bird loves to snuggle, unless you are its enemy! Seemingly
    sweet, it keeps its allies warm in the cold and its enemies chilled by its mischief.
  offensiveAbility: Cottonball Bounce - Shima Enaga prunes its feathers to create
    3 bouncy cotton balls that will bounce enemies in a random direction if touched!
    (last for 8s, 30s cooldown)
  offensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 6c0789d8a65367f4481e4c980f3a0a93, type: 3}
  defensiveAbility: Helping Hand - Ally and self have a 30% cooldown reduction on
    their next ability use. This ability can be activated mid-ally cooldown to reduce
    it. (20s cooldown, this cooldown is immune)
  defensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: d2f9cf5e2f5823d4ebc536bb92dd5a66, type: 3}
